t processing, and oil production. It is bordered by the districts Viluppuram, Nagapattinam and Perambalur. The district is also one of the most robust fishing areas in the state of Tamil Nadu, and home to a large number of fishermen community. The Industrial complex in the district is home to a number of chemical, biotech, pharmaceutical and fertilizer companies.\"],\"stats\":{\"area\":\"3678 sq km\",\"population\":\"26,05,914 (Based on 2011 census)\",\"populationDensity\":\"709 per sq km\",\"sexRatio\":\"987 (Females to 1000 Males)\",\"literacyRate\":\"78.04%\",\"temperature\":\"21°C to 37°C\"},\"resources\":{\"title\":\"Reliable Resources\",\"forestCover\":\"The district has a total forest cover of 417 sq. km\",\"soil\":\"The area is predominantly covered with red soil, alluvial soil and saline.\",\"water\":\"The rivers gadilam, thenpennaiyar, vellar, manimuthar and kollidam barrages are used to irrigate the land.\",\"naturalResources\":\"The region is rich in natural reserves like lignite, natural gas, limestone, white clay, gravel, quartz, laterite, china clay and fire clay.\"},\"resourcesImage\":\"/invest-innovate/invest-innovate-bg.png\",\"infrastructure\":[\"Chennai International Airport\",\"Chennai Port \u0026 Cuddalore Port\",\"Cuddalore Railway Station\",\"1993 Kms Total Network of State \u0026 National Highways\",\"188 Kms Total Railway Track Length\"],\"industries\":[\"Ceramics\",\"Food Processing\",\"Oil Production\",\"Chemical\",\"Biotechnology\",\"Pharmaceutical\",\"Fertilizer\"],\"education\":{\"description\":\"The district has wide spread and well-developed ecosystem of Educational Institutes and facilities.\",\"institutions\":{\"teacherTrainingInstitutions\":38,\"polytechnicColleges\":18,\"generalArtsScienceColleges\":14,\"engineeringColleges\":7,\"pharmacyColleges\":4,\"medicalCollege\":1,\"dentalCollege\":1,\"hotelManagementCollege\":1}},\"companies\":[],\"expert\":{\"name\":\"Prashanth R\",\"email\":\"prashanthr@investtn.in\"}}},\"Perambalur\":{