e automobile sector and its ancillaries.\",\"image\":\"https://storage.investingintamilnadu.com/Guidance/Uploads/Photos/tn-chengalpattu.svg\",\"stats\":{\"Area\":\"2944.96 sq km\",\"Population\":\"2,556,244\",\"Literacy Rate\":\"91.88%\"},\"iconLabels\":[{\"label\":\"Chennai International Airport\"},{\"label\":\"Chennai Port \u0026 Ennore Port\"},{\"label\":\"Chengalpattu Railway Station\"}],\"details\":{\"title\":\"Chengalpattu\",\"heroTitle\":\"Chengalpattu has what it takes for your Business to Flourish\",\"websiteButton\":\"Go to Chengalpattu District Website\",\"heroImage\":\"https://investingintamilnadu.com/DIGIGOV/themes/tnswp/images/prelogin-pages-images/district-img/chengalpattu/chengalpattu.png\",\"description\":[\"The newly created Chengalpattu district located on the north east coast of Tamil Nadu is endowed with nature's beauty. It is bounded on the north by the Chennai district, west by the Kancheepuram district and Thiruvanamalai district and on the south by the Viluppuram district. Maduranthakam Lake is the second largest in the state is spread over 2400 acres. The iconic Mahabalipuram shore temple is in the district. The IT corridor here in the Old Mahabaipuram Road is the home for many major IT companies while it also has a broad-based manufacturing centre for the automobile sector and its ancillaries.\"],\"stats\":{\"area\":\"2944.96 sq km\",\"population\":\"25,56,244 (Based on 2011 census)\",\"populationDensity\":\"868 per sq km\",\"sexRatio\":\"1020 (Females to 1000 Males)\",\"literacyRate\":\"91.88%\",\"temperature\":\"20°C to 37°C\"},\"resources\":{\"title\":\"Reliable Resources\",\"forestCover\":\"The district has a total forest cover of 296* sq. km\",\"soil\":\"The area is predominantly covered with red soil and alluvial soil.\",\"water\":\"The rivers palar, pukkadurai odai, neenjal maduvu and kiliyar barrages are used to irrigate the land.\",\"naturalResources\":\"The region is rich in natural reserves like silica and bentonite.\"},\"resour