ries. River Tamiraparani is the lifeline of this district. Presence of ELCOT IT park at Gangakondan has attracted service sector majors. Cement industries find a major presence due to the limestone availability here. The district is surrounded by the state of Kerala, Gulf of Mannar and the districts of Virudhunagar, Thoothukudi and Kanniyakumari.\",\"image\":\"https://storage.investingintamilnadu.com/Guidance/Uploads/Photos/tn-tirunelveli.svg\",\"stats\":{\"Area\":\"3842.37 sq km\",\"Population\":\"1,665,253\",\"Literacy Rate\":\"82.5%\"},\"iconLabels\":[{\"label\":\"Thoothukudi Domestic Airport \u0026 Madurai International Airport\"},{\"label\":\"Thoothukudi Port\"},{\"label\":\"Tirunelveli Railway Station\"}],\"details\":{\"title\":\"Tirunelveli\",\"heroTitle\":\"Tirunelveli has what it takes for your Business to Flourish\",\"websiteButton\":\"Go to Tirunelveli District Website\",\"heroImage\":\"https://investingintamilnadu.com/DIGIGOV/themes/tnswp/images/prelogin-pages-images/district-img/tirunelveli/tirunelveli.png\",\"description\":[\"Tirunelveli is the only district in the state that extends from the high mountains of the western ghats to the coastline with a variety of natural attractions including waterfalls and wildlife sanctuaries. River Tamiraparani is the lifeline of this district. Presence of ELCOT IT park at Gangakondan has attracted service sector majors. Cement industries find a major presence due to the limestone availability here. The district is surrounded by the state of Kerala, Gulf of Mannar and the districts of Virudhunagar, Thoothukudi and Kanniyakumari.\"],\"stats\":{\"area\":\"3842.37 sq km\",\"population\":\"16,65,253 (Based on 2011 census)\",\"populationDensity\":\"433 per sq km\",\"sexRatio\":\"1023 (Females to 1000 Males)\",\"literacyRate\":\"82.5%\",\"temperature\":\"18°C to 40°C\"},\"resources\":{\"title\":\"Reliable Resources\",\"forestCover\":\"The district has a total forest cover of 1300 sq. km\",\"soil\":\"The area is predominant